.SH NAME
blast-history - Show Git history signals for a file


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBblast history  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show churn and co-change frequency for a file, computed over the last
90 days or the last 200 commits touching the file, whichever is smaller.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for history

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	output machine-readable JSON


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBblast(1)\fP


